- \Master of a component, drawn read only inside every instance of it.
$bog_figmol_app_ghost $mol_view
	store $bog_figmol_store
	- \Frame of the master, empty when the component is gone
	id \
	- \Box of the instance in sheet pixels. The master is stretched into it.
